        <item>
            <title>2.45.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:34:30 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>136</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.45.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- A session can run under another Claude login. Add accounts in Settings → Accounts, then use the Account menu on a pane header or sidebar row to move a session to a different login; it restarts on the same conversation. The sidebar's usage bars show each account separately.
- When a session hits its usage limit, a banner under the composer says which limit and when it resets, and offers to continue on each of your other logins with one click.

### Bug Fixes
- Sessions no longer fail to open when the saved Claude login is damaged; the login screen appears so `/login` can repair it.
- The slash-command menu is no longer hidden behind the session recap.
]]></description>
