        <item>
            <title>2.44.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:18:38 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>135</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.44.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Drop or paste images into the launcher's prompt field to send them with the session's first message. Attached images appear as removable thumbnails, and a first message can be images only. Images that are too large or in an unsupported format are re-encoded automatically.

### Bug Fixes
- The chat now keeps scrolling to new messages after an Edit's diff appears. Before, the view could stop following partway through a response and stay stuck until you scrolled down by hand.
- "Back to Launcher" on the connection overlay now actually returns to the launcher. In a multi-pane layout, the pane stays where it was and turns into a launcher.
]]></description>
