        <item>
            <title>2.43.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:22:16 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>134</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.43.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The launcher now shows the extension download as a percentage ("Downloading extension… 42%")
- The launcher's icon, headline and controls no longer shift when an extension update banner appears or goes away, and the banner sits evenly between the headline and the controls

### Bug Fixes
- Fixed the prompt typed in the launcher sometimes being dropped with Claude Code extension 2.1.280, leaving the new session empty
]]></description>
